# --- Personal data. Never published. -------------------------------------
# The photographs carry the camera body's serial number in the Canon
# MakerNote. The analysis in docs/PHOTOS.md does not need them: it lives in
# the derived JSON in data/, which keeps only model, optics, exposure time,
# aperture and ISO.
fotografias/
*.CR2
*.cr2
*.NEF
*.ARW

# --- Third-party data that downloads itself ------------------------------
# Skyfield fetches these again from NAIF and the IERS on first run.
data/de440s.bsp
data/finals2000A.all

